.SH NAME
\&ag\-cli\-milestone\-list \- List repository milestones
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&ag\-cli milestone list [<owner>/<repo>] [flags]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&List repository milestones
.PP
\&When OWNER/REPO is omitted, the repository is inferred from the current Git repository. An explicit OWNER/REPO argument always takes precedence. Remote selection prefers remote.pushDefault, the current branch upstream, origin, then a unique AtomGit/GitCode remote.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-direction <string>\fR
\&Sort direction: asc, desc
\&Default: \(dqasc\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
\&Output milestones as JSON
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-L, \-\-limit <int>\fR
\&Maximum number of milestones to list
\&Default: \(dq30\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-sort <string>\fR
\&Sort milestones by created or due_on
\&Default: \(dqdue_on\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-s, \-\-state <string>\fR
\&Filter by state: open, closed, all
\&Default: \(dqopen\(dq.
.SH INHERITED OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
\&Show help for command
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-raw\-output\fR
\&Disable terminal output sanitization for machine processing
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
\&ag\-cli milestone list owner/repo \-\-state all \-\-limit 50
.fi
